Subject: [PATCH 1/4] evox9: Sync spoof profile repo and default PIF selection
 from upstream

- PixelDeviceRepository: add bluejay (Pixel 6a) canary profile as default
  PIF profile paired with 2026-10-05 security patch
- AxSpoofManager: use getDefaultPifCodename for default profile selection
---
